zing Fire.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"targetKey":"88:4:2","targetGloss":"(in) a Fire","targetTransliteration":"nāran","sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"]},{"ref":"90:20","tokens":[{"key":"90:20:1","position":1,"arabic":"عَلَيْهِمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"Over them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","lemma":"عَلَىٰ","root":null,"entryId":"l-08dd9283adb70e54"},{"key":"90:20:2","position":2,"arabic":"نَارٌۭ","kind":"word","gloss":"(will be the) Fire","transliteration":"nārun","lemma":"نَار","root":"نور","entryId":"l-1f4c1e0172701e6e"},{"key":"90:20:3","position":3,"arabic":"مُّؤْصَدَةٌۢ","kind":"word","gloss":"closed in","transliteration":"mu'ṣadatun","lemma":"مُّؤْصَدَة","root":"وصد","entryId":null},{"key":"90:20:4","position":4,"arabic":"٢٠","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}],"translation":"The Fire will be shut over them (i.e. they will be enveloped by the Fire without any opening or window or outlet.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[{"text":"\"Therein breathing out with deep sighs and roaring will be their portion, and therein they will hear not. **\" [The Qur’ân, Verse 21:100] **Ibn Mas‘ûd رضي الله عنه recited this Verse and then said: \"When those (who are destined to remain in the Hell-fire forever) will be thrown in the Hell-fire, each of them will be put in a separate Tabût (Box) of Fire, so that he will not see anyone punished in the Hell-fire except he himself.\" Then Ibn Mas‘ûd recited this Verse (V.21:100). [Tafsîr Ibn Kathîr, Tabarî and Qurtubî].","ref":null}],"targetKey":"90:20:2","targetGloss":"(will be the) Fire","targetTransliteration":"nārun","sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"]}]}